         "  - `capability_mismatch`, `unknown_action`, `rate_limited` or `storage_failure`:"),
        ("attempted required", "r",
         "A consumer MUST NOT require `accepted` or\n`attempted` before `driver_reported`.",
         "A consumer MUST require `accepted` or\n`attempted` before `driver_reported`."),
        ("storage_failure resend becomes a duplicate", "r",
         "and it is\njudged as a new command.", "and it is\na duplicate."),
        ("driver_reported allows a third outcome", "r",
