        ("command domain changed", "c2",
         "| Command | `ori.firmware_command.v2` |", "| Command | `ori.firmware_command.v3` |"),
        ("verdict added to commands v2", "c2",
         "| `storage_failure` | The high-water mark",
         "| `power_failure` | x |\n| `storage_failure` | The high-water mark"),
